        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.italia-italy.org/en/lazio-turismo-H501-roma",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The fountain of the Four Rivers by Bernini, a Baroque masterpiece, sits in Rome's heart.",
